                        ex:ActionMotivation ;
               ex:isIncompatibleWith ex:Externalist ;
               skos:definition "the internalist view states that ethical judgements have a special internal relation to motivation, in that they are sufficient in-and-of-themselves to explain an individual's actions (Chrisman 2016)." .


