###  http://www.github.com/silvialx/Onto/WrongKindOfReasonsProblem
ex:WrongKindOfReasonsProblem rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      <http://www.github.com/argumentsontology/Argument> ;
                             <http://www.github.com/argumentsontology/hasConclusion> ex:FittingAttitudeAnalysesCannotDistinguishRightFromWrongKindReasons ;
                             <http://www.github.com/argumentsontology/hasPremise> ex:FittingAttitudeAnalysesDefineValueViaWarrantedProAttitudes ,
