ex:truthPluralism rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                           ex:TruthTheorySupposition ;
                  rdfs:comment "truth is constituted differently in different domains of discourse (Wright, Lynch)." .


###  http://www.github.com/silvialx/Onto/truthPragmatism
ex:truthPragmatism rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                            ex:TruthTheorySupposition ;
